  "description": "The registry of CultureTechLens' 232 published Cited Photo Archive evidence cards: per photo, registry ID, title, photographer, source, rights statement, what it documents, the citation as published, page/file URLs, and an AEO question and answer. All 232 rows are rights-stated (119 public domain; the rest CC and CC0); none uncleared. Extracted verbatim from culturetechlens.com/photos/ on 2026-11-04 and governed by CTL-PHOTO-001/002. Distinct from the internal Photo Rights Log v4 \u2014 the two are never merged.",
  "keywords": [
    "photography",
    "photo archive",
    "Black history",
    "rights-cleared",
    "Wikimedia Commons",
    "Library of Congress",
    "CultureTechLens"
  ],
